        "x0": 89.0,
        "y0": 490.06,
        "x1": 523.04,
        "y1": 516.52
      },
      "text": "Under additional assumptions on the eigenvalues we can derive a stronger result directly relating the approximated log-likelihood with the true likelihood.",
      "text_sha256": "5098251e15e4a74b971b50066514d6d71f52f8e67bfc2132802dc32e2eb85a98"
