        "x1": 507.0,
        "y1": 547.0
      },
      "text": "Theorem 14 Let the conditions of Theorem 2 hold. If ∏λj∈spec(Σi) λj ≥ 1/(2π)d we have",
      "text_sha256": "faf51bd6cc589b2bec64530fada5e82aca6d4fc90155c0b52491969477d08ea9",
